"• MP4: Most compatible\n"
"• MKV: More features\n"
"• MOV: Apple/ProRes workflows\n"
"• WebM: Web optimized (VP9/AV1)"
msgstr ""
"• MP4: 가장 호환성이 높음  \n"
"• MKV: 더 많은 기능  \n"
"• MOV: Apple/ProRes 워크플로우  \n"
"• WebM: 웹 최적화 (VP9/AV1)"

